19) Calculate basic CLV

You are now ready to calculate average customer lifetime with three different methods! In this exercise you will calculate the basic CLV which multiplies average monthly spent with the projected customer lifespan. The pandas and numpy libraries have been loaded as pd as np respectively. The online dataset has been imported for you.

# Calculate monthly spend per customer
monthly_revenue = online.groupby(['CustomerID','InvoiceMonth'])['TotalSum'].sum()
# Calculate average monthly spend
